  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThe Pastel Nostalgia recipe infuses your images with a light, yellow-toned veil, eliciting a delicate sense of nostalgia and warmth. This recipe is ideally tailored for blue, yellow, or other vibrantly colorful photos, as well as those carrying a subtle hint of retro charm.\nTo maximize the recipe’s effect, consider slightly increasing the exposure when capturing your shot, it works particularly wonderful with brighter images. This heart-tugging allure can transform your images to a realm of nostalgic beauty and evocative sentiment.",
